Riseonly patch on zed 6b2aa1c (Apache-2.0 crates gpui and gpui_wgpu), applied by scripts/vendor-gpui.py.
Off macOS PaintSurface carries an OwnedSurfaceFrame (CPU NV12); the wgpu renderer uploads it into
per-stream R8/RG8 textures and draws it with its existing surfaces pipeline (P41, P27 lin).

